#: ../../source/quickstart.md:1 084fd73774f64065a11753617350dd8e
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:3 c89a7afd6bd841ec8cc8efd827d0571e
msgid "这页只做一件事：从安装到生成第一批候选结构。跑通以后，再去看完整清洗流程和每张卡片的参数。"
msgstr ""
"This page takes you from installation to a first set of candidate "
"structures. Once that path works, continue with the full cleaning "
"workflow and the parameter reference for individual cards."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:5 bb698f43ea99410c8084a668b99f1a40
msgid ""
"如果软件已经能正常启动，你只是想查某个页面的按钮或参数，不必从头阅读本页，直接进入 "
"[功能指南](module/index.rst)。功能指南按桌面软件页面顺序组织。"
msgstr ""
"If the application already starts normally and you only need to look up a"
" button or parameter, you do not need to read this page from the "
"beginning. Go straight to the [Feature Guide](module/index.rst), which "
"follows the order of the desktop interface."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:8 5c59a937546340d1b60ea02f6b12798a
msgid "1. 安装"
msgstr "1. Install NepTrainKit"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:10 ab7b2829ad7e41fa89b2be5c867b7fdd
msgid "建议使用独立环境，Python 版本用 3.10 到 3.13。"
msgstr "Use an isolated environment with Python 3.10 through 3.13."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:12 2c720e645df04729a3eb4122b608d58f
msgid ""
"conda create -n nepkit python=3.10\n"
"conda activate nepkit\n"
"pip install NepTrainKit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:18 e11f1cda3ce744ff9c345e27ddcc1fb0
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 会安装独立的 `nep-adapters` 运行时。macOS 和 Windows wheel 提供 CPU；Linux "
"x86_64 wheel 同时提供 CPU 和 CUDA。安装 wheel 不要求本机安装 CUDA Toolkit 或 NVCC，但 CUDA "
"计算需要兼容的 NVIDIA 驱动。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit installs the separate `nep-adapters` runtime. The macOS and "
"Windows wheels provide CPU support, while the Linux x86_64 wheel provides"
" both CPU and CUDA. Installing a wheel does not require a local CUDA "
"Toolkit or NVCC, but CUDA calculations require a compatible NVIDIA "
"driver."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:20 5fc4f671e08b4e1a947f8fe591ee5653
msgid "安装后先确认运行时状态："
msgstr "Confirm the runtime status after installation:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:22 3c1967a41b7a4c3689eaf0b68703e4ac
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:26 c12d4ce5994c44a39c50b7b25d447117
msgid ""
"如果 `cuda` 显示不可用，NepTrainKit 的 `Auto` 模式会说明原因并使用 CPU。只有在必须使用 CUDA 时才明确选择 "
"`CUDA`；不可用时程序会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"If `cuda` is unavailable, NepTrainKit's `Auto` mode explains why and uses"
" the CPU. Select `CUDA` explicitly only when CUDA is required; the "
"application will report an error if it is unavailable."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:28 7d64d0ddbec641c98740476d4e263ab7
msgid "启动软件："
msgstr "Launch the application:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:30 5f056dc03d014cd48e86a5de41c7a877
msgid "nepkit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:34 2b85b5db4e9d4b6aa185d2c0d3eff237
msgid "2. 打开 生成数据集"
msgstr "2. Open Make Dataset"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:36 46d7269f7b5840cdac3afa0f13fe7ce4
msgid ""
"第一次建议从 `生成数据集` 开始。它的职责是制作训练集候选结构：输入一批基础结构， "
"选择一张或多张卡片，生成应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性构型。"
msgstr ""
"For your first run, start with `Make Dataset`. Its role is to create "
"candidate structures for a training set: load a group of base structures,"
" choose one or more cards, and generate strained, perturbed, defective, "
"surface, doped, or magnetic configurations."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:39 d10e4b3329ae419baa5a2748601467eb
msgid ""
"切到 `生成数据集` 后，先点击窗口顶部的 `Open` 按钮导入初始结构。这里的初始结构 通常是已经弛豫好的 "
"`xyz`、`extxyz`、`POSCAR` 或 `CIF` 文件；后面的卡片都会以这批结构 作为输入继续生成候选构型。"
msgstr ""
"After switching to `Make Dataset`, click `Open` at the top of the window "
"to import the starting structures. These are usually relaxed `xyz`, "
"`extxyz`, `POSCAR`, or `CIF` files. The cards that follow use this set of"
" structures as their input and generate candidate configurations."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:43 61954afaf02b4c9a9ea2ac0c80e4d75a
msgid "生成数据集 empty workspace"
msgstr "Empty Make Dataset workspace"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:43 61954afaf02b4c9a9ea2ac0c80e4d75a
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:48 571f075630fe4788af262d016999c625
msgid "图中需要记住四个位置："
msgstr "Remember these four areas:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 a1ddd92c77da4c7d81ad001af42c973a
msgid "`Open input structures`：导入初始结构。没有输入结构时，多数生成卡片没有可处理对象。"
msgstr ""
"`Open input structures`: import the starting structures. Most generation "
"cards have nothing to process until an input has been loaded."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:51 44c8469e746548e796f01d200ac33c0e
msgid "`Add new card`：添加构型生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "`Add new card`: add a structure-generation or filtering operation."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:52 263dab51af5847069307ae117e480bc8
msgid "`Run selected cards`：只运行已勾选的卡片。"
msgstr "`Run selected cards`: run only the cards that are currently selected."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:53 cf2cc034b2c2405c89f0a135320e1a01
msgid "`Workflow workspace`：卡片会按顺序放在这里，后续也在这里检查结果和导出。"
msgstr ""
"`Workflow workspace`: cards appear here in execution order; use the same "
"area to inspect and export their results."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:55 58404ba4028141beb06dfe618f260ddb
msgid "3. 生成一组候选结构"
msgstr "3. Generate a candidate set"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:57 69bad9bc3feb412bb1fb174410082f75
msgid ""
"这里用“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”作为第一张卡。它的输入是已有结构，输出是一组晶格被拉伸或压缩后的结构。 "
"这一步得到的是候选结构，不是最终训练集。"
msgstr ""
"We use “Lattice Strain” as the first card. It takes existing structures "
"as input and outputs structures with expanded or compressed cells. The "
"result is a candidate set, not the final training set."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:60 d90928237fc54e1d8ae8e7d29e0352e4
msgid "先用 `Open` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Import a starting structure with `Open`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:61 777aef168a6c42b9b0ac9c2eb61a671b
msgid "点击 `Add new card`。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:62 53a3b26809ec4f7794e8316d8638372f
msgid "选择“晶格应变（`Lattice Strain`）”。"
msgstr "Choose “Lattice Strain”."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:63 35c4512413dd45dd9de4e8b08050e4fd
msgid "设置一个小范围，例如 X/Y/Z 都从 `-2%` 到 `2%`，步长 `1%`。"
msgstr ""
"Use a small initial range, for example `-2%` to `2%` along X, Y, and Z "
"with a `1%` step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:64 78098a30e8a5478591aec640d6346f88
msgid "勾选这张卡，点击顶部 `Run`。"
msgstr "Select the card and click `Run` in the title bar."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:65 faff077e692b478c95566ed3b102b908
msgid "运行完成后，从卡片上的导出按钮保存结果。"
msgstr "When the run finishes, save the result with the export button on the card."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:67 ae67fc0228814951a13dbc70b1a6e188
msgid "晶格应变卡片快速上手"
msgstr "Lattice Strain card quick start"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:67 ae67fc0228814951a13dbc70b1a6e188
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:72 b705ee6265db4a648768418b1b528bdb
msgid "这张图对应的使用逻辑是："
msgstr "Here is the logic behind this workflow:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:74 d71050c663c84593857f9a893117e5ff
msgid "先添加卡片，不要一开始就改很多高级参数。"
msgstr "Add the card first; do not begin by changing every advanced option."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:75 b9cc021b03f6452cbe6d96aeea3e1be7
msgid "只改与物理目标直接相关的范围，例如应变轴、最小值、最大值、步长。"
msgstr ""
"Change only the ranges tied directly to the physical objective, such as "
"the strain axes, minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:76 c1e1b39b9e4642bfab1f52383dc78013
msgid "运行后先看输出数量是否符合预期，再导出到下一步检查。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the output count is plausible before exporting the structures "
"for inspection."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:78 4eebba56a7f249ba88a25f047ba0faa5
msgid "4. 检查候选结构"
msgstr "4. Inspect the candidates"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:80 f40b3ad6a47b44fd96284b2ddb1f06a2
msgid "`生成数据集` 生成的是候选结构，不建议默认直接送 DFT。最短检查路径是："
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` produces candidate structures, which should not normally "
"be sent directly to DFT. The shortest inspection path is:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:82 55c85e317b8546eda68d8dc844e42245
msgid "NEP Dataset Display overview"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display overview"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:82 55c85e317b8546eda68d8dc844e42245
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:87 5c808580b3f7489caab67e2c397aabd0
msgid "在 `NEP Dataset Display` 打开候选结构。"
msgstr "Open the candidates in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:88 9eed536de2f6479a9a4528cfe5b1e5cd
msgid "先看结构和明显异常点。"
msgstr "Inspect the structures and the most obvious outliers first."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:89 f652979546a444ff9af180b280e2a135
msgid "删除或单独导出异常样本。"
msgstr "Delete problematic samples or export them separately for investigation."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:90 28e499cd78e3465da655d8a430e1dd18
msgid "清洗后再决定是否做 FPS 代表性采样。"
msgstr "After cleaning, decide whether representative FPS sampling is needed."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:92 4e1432a8830d4155a09024e5640d8e42
msgid "5. 进入 DFT 和训练"
msgstr "5. Continue to DFT and training"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:94 d899352f44a14818891f60b04f4e0fa6
msgid ""
"清洗后的结构再送去做第一性原理计算。DFT 标注完成后，用 GPUMD 训练 NEP； 训练结束后，再回到 `NEP Dataset "
"Display` 查看训练误差。"
msgstr ""
"Send the cleaned structures to first-principles calculations. Once DFT "
"labels are available, train the NEP model with GPUMD. Return to `NEP "
"Dataset Display` after training to inspect the errors."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:97 599e8e1142914a109cf10de147b33c72
msgid ""
"完整的清洗顺序、为什么不要先 FPS、以及如何用 NEP 预测做预筛，见 [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](workflows/clean-"
"candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete order of operations, why FPS should not "
"come first, and how to use NEP predictions for prescreening."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:100 c56e3a3cc853433e90c3384528c9a0ae
msgid ""
"如果你在做缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性结构，直接去看 [生成数据集卡片手册](module/make-dataset-"
"cards/index.md)。手册按卡片用途组织，比逐个试菜单更快。"
msgstr ""
"If you are creating defect, surface, doped, or magnetic structures, go "
"directly to the [Make Dataset card manual](module/make-dataset-"
"cards/index.md). It is organized by purpose, which is faster than trying "
"cards one by one from the menu."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:102 66c28a60adba4b84a7a30ed670aad652
msgid ""
"如果你要从标准晶体开始，而不是导入已有结构，可以先用 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 生成 "
"`fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp` 或 `fcc111` 原型。需要扫 fcc (111) 的 GSFE 路径时，先生成 `fcc111` "
"原型，再接 `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`；不要把普通 cubic `fcc` cell 直接拿去扫 `(111)`。"
msgstr ""
"If you are starting from a standard crystal instead of importing an "
"existing structure, use `Crystal Prototype Builder` to create an `fcc`, "
"`bcc`, `hcp`, or `fcc111` prototype. For an fcc (111) GSFE path, generate"
" the `fcc111` prototype first and then add `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`; "
"do not use a regular cubic `fcc` cell directly for a `(111)` scan."

